  "cadence is the in-game reset for that difficulty: daily, weekly (Thursday 00:00 UTC) or monthly (1st 00:00 UTC). In GMS only Hard and Extreme Black Mage are monthly; Extreme Lotus/Seren/Kalos/Kaling/First Adversary reset weekly.",
  "presets: the default weekly boss lists, in progression order (Nathan's chart, 2026-10-01). partySize defaults to 1; main marks presets for the main character. The app copies them into bossing/presets.json on first edit; the Presets page edits that copy.",
  "Rechecked 2026-09-24 against the wiki's GMS table (still labelled v270): no value changed in v.271."
